  "body": "CoAkka Runtime public artifact train 1.3.4.\n\nThis release supersedes the prepared 1.3.3 runtime payload for new consumers. Native generation 1.3.4+dc6ec284 fixes late dynamic loading on Linux ARM64 and is carried by the connector artifacts in generation 1.3.4+dc6ec284-f68ff5c.\n\nValidated surfaces include Linux ARM64 Node-to-Python request/reply, Go v1.3.12, Swift v1.3.4, native C/C++, coakka-client, and coakka-runtime-inspect on macOS, Linux, and Windows. Package-manager registry versions remain independently published and are documented in docs/current-packages.md.\n\nUse artifacts/public-artifacts.tsv and SHA256SUMS as the release inventory and checksum sources.",
